<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait's sale of Santa Fe still pending-minister.</title>
<headline>Kuwait's sale of Santa Fe still pending-minister.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait said on Tuesday it has not finalised the sale of its North Sea exploration firm Santa Fe.</p>
<p>&quot;The issue has not been determined till now,&quot; Oil Minister Isa al-Mazeedi told reporters when pressed to comment on rumours that Norway's Saga Petroleum ASA had bought Santa Fa.</p>
<p>He refused to elaborate. Saga on Monday declined comment on the rumours.</p>
<p>The Financial Times reported on Saturday that there was market talk that British-based Santa Fe had been sold to Saga for one billon stg ($1.67 billion).</p>
</text>
